# Shopping list

The block below is *written by this template* from the vault's own frontmatter,
which is why it cannot exist until the vault has been rendered once.

{{ "{#shopping}" }}
```python
import json

# One entry per note carrying a `flour:` field, emitted by shopping.md.jinja.
loaves = {
{%- for n in notes %}{% if n.frontmatter.flour %}
    "{{ n.title }}": {{ n.frontmatter.flour }},
{%- endif %}{% endfor %}
}

print(
    json.dumps(
        {
            "shopping": {
                "loaf_count": len(loaves),
                "total_flour": sum(loaves.values()),
            }
        }
    )
)
```
